---
/**
 * The block: the orange shape that carries the one-take between scenes.
 * It is born when the intro's field squeezes into the skills strip, folds into
 * the Work frame, and leaves after Work. It never parks on screen. Its corner
 * box here is only the reference that blockOver() scales from.
 * Hidden unless motion is on.
 */
---

<div class="stage-block" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .stage-block {
    position: fixed;
    /* Under positioned text (z 10), so copy scrolling past reads on top of the
       orange instead of vanishing behind it. Still above plain page content. */
    z-index: 5;
    right: 1.25rem;
    bottom: 1.25rem;
    width: clamp(2.75rem, 7vmin, 5.5rem);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: var(--color-signal);
    visibility: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .stage-block {
      right: 2rem;
      bottom: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
